      ":question/math-academy-id": "q-68929",
      ":question/problem": "Jennifer is doing a science experiment in her Chemistry class. She takes a liquid with a temperature of $10.1^{\u2218}C$ and places it in a refrigerator. After half an hour, she removes the liquid from the refrigerator and places it on a table. She concludes that the temperature decreased by $12.7^{\u2218}C$.\n\nAfter half an hour, Jennifer takes the temperature of the liquid again and finds that the temperature increased by $8^{\u2218}C$. What is the final temperature of the liquid?"
